<h2>1. Accessibility Commitment</h2>
<p>Aimad Ul Islam is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for individuals with disabilities. We continuously improve the user experience for everyone and apply relevant accessibility standards compliant with <strong>Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA</strong>.</p>

<h2>2. Features Implemented</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Full Keyboard Navigation:</strong> Tab order, skip links, and accessible modal dialog controls (`Cmd+K` search modal).</li>
    <li><strong>High Contrast Color Palette:</strong> Tested against WCAG AA 4.5:1 ratio contrast requirements for text on dark neon and light backgrounds.</li>
    <li><strong>Semantic Markup:</strong> Proper use of standard HTML5 elements (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<article>`, `<nav>`, `<footer>`, `<aside>`).</li>
    <li><strong>Screen Reader Support:</strong> Descriptive `aria-label` attributes on interactive buttons and decorative icon hides (`aria-hidden="true"`).</li>
</ul>
